# image_filters.png, rendered by the stock engine's flutter_tester with
# Impeller, against fl-engine's frame through emblema, both at DPR 2.
# Percent of pixels allowed to differ in any channel, and by more than 32.
#
# Blur, dilate, erode, a color filter and two compositions, on a paint,
# through saveLayer, as an ImageFiltered layer and as a BackdropFilter. Each
# filter alone agrees but for blur edges a level or two apart. What differs
# by more than 32 is the compositions: blur over dilate on a paint is
# thinner here (cell 7), and a composition in a layer stops its halo short
# of the cell's edge where Impeller's reaches it (cells 14, 15, 22, 23);
# and erode, where Impeller's saveLayer and layer disagree with each other
# (cells 12 and 28). Measured 2026-11-20, lavapipe, emblema with
# jwinarske/emblema#275 and #276: 20.802% differ, 1.773% by more than 32.
differ 23.0
differ_over_32 2.0
